        "excerptChars": 254,
        "excerptText": "\"U.S. Person\": any\nUnited States citizen, lawful permanent resident, entity organized under the laws of the United States or any jurisdiction within the\nUnited States, including any foreign branch of any such entity, or any person in the United States.\n\n"
